hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"28","[AI-translation] Ibn-e-Abbas se riwayat hai, kehne lage: Surah Al-An'am Makkah mein raat mein ek saath nazil hui, iske gird sat hazaar farishte the jo iske gird tasbeeh ki pukaar karte the."
"29","[AI-translation] Jab Surah Al-An'am nazil hui to Rasoolullah, sallallahu alaihi wasallam, ne tasbeeh ki aur farmaya: Yaqeenan is surah ko aise farishte milay jo ufq ko bhar chuke."
"30","[AI-translation] Abu Lubabah se riwayat hai, kehne lage: Aisha, radiyallahu anha, farmati thin: Nabi, sallallahu alaihi wasallam, neend nahi lete the jab tak Az-Zumar aur Bani Israel parh nahi lete."
